OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1786645112
OL,3,CCoop stops selling disposable BBQs due
OL,4,Cto dry weather
OL,6,FThe Channel Islands Coop has removed
OL,7,Fdisposable barbecues from its shelves
OL,8,Fas dry weather continues across both
OL,9,FBailiwicks.
OL,11,FThe supermarket hopes the
OL,12,F"precautionary decision" will keep
OL,13,Fshoppers in Jersey and Guernsey safe
OL,14,Fand reduce the risk of wildfires.
OL,16,FIt follows UK Prime Minister Andy
OL,17,FBurnham urging "retailers big and
OL,18,Fsmall" to stop selling disposable
OL,19,Fbarbecues in response to the extreme
OL,20,Fheat conditions.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
