CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1786645112
OL,3,CCoop stops selling disposable BBQs due
OL,4,Cto dry weather
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Jersey Met announced
OL,7,Fearlier this week that parts of the
OL,8,Fisland has entered a drought due to
OL,9,Fthe prolonged lack of rainfall.
OL,11,FIn Guernsey, the fire service has
OL,12,Furged people to be wary of throwing
OL,13,Faway cigarette butts and glass
OL,14,Fbottles, after dealing with a
OL,15,F"significant" grass blaze earlier this
OL,16,Fmonth.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
