FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1786645112
OL,3,CCoop stops selling disposable BBQs due
OL,4,Cto dry weather
OL,6,FIn a statement, the organisation
OL,7,Fexplains: "As a responsible retailer,
OL,8,Fthe Channel Islands Coop, alongside
OL,9,Fmany other retailers, has taken the
OL,10,Fprecautionary decision to temporarily
OL,11,Fwithdraw disposable barbecues from
OL,12,Fsale due to the current hot and dry
OL,13,Fweather conditions and the increased
OL,14,Frisk of fire.
OL,16,F"The safety of our members, customers
OL,17,Fand local communities is always our
OL,18,Fpriority.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
