CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1786645112
OL,3,CCoop stops selling disposable BBQs due
OL,4,Cto dry weather
OL,6,F"We will continue to monitor
OL,7,Fconditions and will return them to
OL,8,Fsale when it is appropriate and safe
OL,9,Fto do so."
